    "variant_map_names": "NaviMapData.ItemKeyName associates he04 with NAVI_MAP_HE03, fz04/fz05 with NAVI_MAP_FZ01, and bt08 with NAVI_MAP_BT01. These labels describe the broad region.",
    "area_names": "ra01_01 and ra01_02 observed at RA_SAVE01 and RA_SAVE02 on 2026-09-21; AreaSelectData resolves those save points to Tower and Hills. ca02_Lagoon observed at ca_02_Lv_Save_05 on 2026-09-21; CA_SAVE08 resolves that start to Sandbar Isle. They are reference landmarks, not a claim that every named zone boundary changes the minimap.",
    "caribbean_areas": "AreaSelectData and NauticalChartData destinations visited on EGS on 2026-09-21; labels from English kh3_map.locres and kh3_level.locres. Offshore arrivals were followed by on-island/underwater landings where required. Verification evidence lives in build/kh3-caribbean-reference; see docs/minimap_reference.md for the durable route summary."
  },
